{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>Lift the heads of all the congregation of the children of Israel.</b> says the Rav Bekhor Shor: By means of בקע לגלגלת in כי תשא, their total — all of Israel together — became known, as it is written there לשש מאות, while here we find each and every tribe with its own banner separately, as it is said: למשפחותם לבית אבותם. And in the plains of Moab He counted those born of these, just before entry into the land, for among them there was not a man from those counted by Moses and Aaron."], :book :numbers, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:08:55.222003573Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}